    <string name="omni_about_developer">Eaquel · github.com/Eaquel/Omni_Builder</string>
    <string name="omni_about_how">A project is a manifest, folders for the languages you chose, and a resource folder. Pressing build compiles the resource table, writes the binary manifest, packs the archive, signs it, and writes a package to install and a bundle to upload. Everything happens on this device: no server sees your project, and nothing but the Android tools you already have is used.</string>
    <string name="omni_about_watch">The signature on this application is checked at every start and every return to this screen, and again in the background while Android allows it.</string>
